a  in that in this version he seems to look  more dinosaurian in appearance  he has sharp scales around his neck and  back as well as  a loose flappy scale-like texture that  overlaps one another in  rows along his upper thigh and arms  godzilla versus godzilla has the same  thick ties as the earlier versions  and his arms are smaller in relative to  his body but it's not really a  disadvantage  or a big deal as we can see him being  able to bit slap kong into oblivion  godzilla's claws are black in color and  his feet are wider and resemble an  elephant  foot more or less than the other  godzilla's feet do  the feet are then altered in 2019 and  2021 which is now  to more closely resemble those of past  designs  with larger curved claws and each toe  set more apart from the other  godzilla's singular point however has  more defined elbows  and might i say curvier legs the design  is made to closely resemble dinosaurs  and the claws of this godzilla feet are  very big and there are three toes  with an extra small one above the heel  the limbs make this version of the g-man  look more animalistic and primal in  nature  now let's go up and look at the dorsal  plates  while legendary godzilla's dorsal plates  were originally straight and sharp  his battle with demuto prime enabled his  broken place to regrow and have a more  distinctive maple like shape instead of  being jagged and straighter in design  the new design features more protrusions  and the three large central dorsal  plates running from the midway down his  back  are the same shape as the original  godzilla's dorsal blades  singular point godzilla's dorsal plates  however are one of my favorite designs  to be honest  first of all they have a different  coloration in contrast with the body  that is black  the plates are whitish in color with red  vines that run in between them  and makes them look like a leaf they are  also present in more numbers and arrange  in more rows than legendaries  godzilla's tale 