nd a weight that is only  336 tons  shy of a hundred thousand the second  heaviest next to godzilla earth  singular point godzilla has not been  released as yet  and so has its statistics but is  suspected to be smaller than both  shin and legendary godzilla's behavior  is that of territorial animal  a monster versus godzilla that is ishiro  sarizawa theorized that godzilla  is the driving force to restore balance  to nature whenever that balance is  disrupted  suggesting that he is essentially the  ruler of earth and he considers the  entire earth to be his territory  in godzilla's singular point however the  story would depict  a couple of young geniuses mei kamino  who is a female researcher and  yoon arikawa who is a male engineer as  they take on an unprecedented threat  with their companions it might be that  godzilla in this universe  would be the main threat against  humanity going back to his roots as does  destruction  incarnate which is quite opposite to  most of us godzilla as he is a protector  anyway what do you think about this  video on the comparison of legendary  godzilla 2021 from  godzilla vs kong and that one from toho  slash netflix  godzilla's singular point if you have  noticed something more then do put them  down in the comments section  okay these are the two godzillas from  2021 that we will be seeing in the next  two months  yeah this year will be the year of the  kaiju so subscribe if you haven't  smash that subscribe button to be a part  of the minecube family  and slap slap slap that notification  bell for regular updates  on new video releases till the next  video  take care fam
 

